---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/Sections/PageHeader.astro";
import Button from "../components/UI/Button.astro";
---
---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="奉献支持">
  <main class="bg-[#F9F4EF] min-h-screen py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-sm p-8 md:p-16">
      
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#5C5146] mb-4">奉献支持</h1>
        <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-[#D4A373] mx-auto"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-lg text-gray-700 leading-loose">
        <p class="text-center font-medium text-xl">
          若天父给您感动，希望奉献支持，请联系 <span class="text-[#D4A373]">Neo小盐弟兄</span>。
        </p>
        
        <div class="bg-[#FDFBF9] border-l-4 border-[#D4A373] p-6 italic">
          您的奉献会匿名公布。
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-[#5C5146] mb-2">奉献用途：</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
            <li>支持平台的行政开支。</li>
            <li>补贴咨询师辅导费用。</li>
            <li>支持在“没有听过的福音地区”的宣教事工。</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 my-10" />

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#5C5146] mb-6 text-center">奉献动机的确认</h3>
          <p class="mb-6">请确认您的奉献动机是为了<strong>回应上帝的救恩</strong>。</p>
          
          <p class="text-[#D4A373] font-medium mb-4">请避免以下三种动机：</p>
          
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              <strong class="block text-red-400 mb-1">1. 恐惧</strong>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">“如果不奉献，上帝会惩罚我。”</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              <strong class="block text-red-400 mb-1">2. 交易</strong>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">“如果我奉献，上帝会让我赚更多钱。”</span>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              <strong class="block text-red-400 mb-1">3. 自我</strong>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">“我有钱，奉献让我体验到有价值。”</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm">
        如有疑问，请通过平台联系方式咨询
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
